.TH AI-WORKFLOW 7 "May 2026" "v1.0" "Sovereign Mesh Manual"
.SH NAME
ai-workflow \- Dual AI operational modes of the Sovereign Mesh
.SH DESCRIPTION
The **Sovereign Mesh** supports two primary AI workflows designed to provide a balance between cloud-augmented reasoning and private, local autonomy.
.SH WORKFLOW A: CLOUD-AUGMENTED (WITH GEMINI-CLI)
This workflow is the default mode for high-level orchestration, utilizing cloud-based models and large context windows.
.SS Components
.IP \(bu 2
\fBBrain:\fR Gemini Pro / Flash.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBInterface:\fR \fBgemini-cli\fR.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBDelegation:\fR Invokes specialized cloud sub-agents.
.SH WORKFLOW B: SOVEREIGN-LOCAL (WITHOUT GEMINI-CLI)
This workflow is designed for private, air-gapped, or low-latency environments, running entirely on the local mesh infrastructure.
.SS Components
.IP \(bu 2
\fBBrain:\fR Local Gemma / CodeGemma models.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBInterface:\fR \fBgemma-ui\fR (IDE) and \fBsovereign-auto\fR (CLI).
.IP \(bu 2
\fBMemory:\fR Permanent recall via CockroachDB \fBagentic_memories\fR.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBTools:\fR Native MCP suite (Port 1111).
.SS Operational Features
.TP
\fB/backup\fR
Gemma can consult the cloud Mothership for complex queries while remaining the final local arbiter.
.TP
\fBPerfect Recall\fR
Memories are automatically injected into the system prompt on every cycle.
.SH COMPARISON
.TS
tab(|);
L | L | L.
Feature | Workflow A | Workflow B
_
Model | Gemini Cloud | Local Gemma
Privacy | Cloud | 100% Local
Memory | Session | Permanent
Latency | Network | Sub-second
.TE
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBsovereign-auto\fR(1), \fBgmudd\fR(8), \fBstarbirth\fR(7)
.SH AUTHOR
Sovereign Mesh Core Developers
